          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h1",
           "text": "Logo Design Portfolio: Custom Logos by Logo Austin",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>These are recent custom logos created by Logo Austin's designers for small businesses, startups and organizations. Every logo was designed from scratch based on the client's business name and vision.</p>",
