          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "What You Will See in Our Portfolio",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>The portfolio includes wordmarks, icon-and-text logos, emblems and illustrated mascot logos across many industries. Looking through it is the quickest way to judge whether a designer's range fits your brand. Notice how each logo reads at small sizes and in a single color, since that is how most logos are used day to day.</p><p>Want a logo for a specific industry? See examples and advice for <a href=\"/construction-logo-design/\">construction</a>, <a href=\"/real-estate-logo-design/\">real estate</a>, <a href=\"/cleaning-logo-design/\">cleaning</a>, <a href=\"/clothing-line-logo-design/\">clothing lines</a> and <a href=\"/small-business-logo-design/\">small businesses</a>.</p>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
